{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2023-04-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'UNITED WILL FLY NON-STOP TO 100+ INTERNATIONAL CITIES THIS SUMMER TO MEET SOARING OVERSEAS TRAVEL DEMAND', 'text': "UNITED IS THE LARGEST CARRIER ACROSS BOTH THE ATLANTIC AND\xa0PACIFIC, ADDING NEARLY 25 NEW ROUTES TO THE SUMMER SCHEDULE INTERNATIONAL BOOKINGS ON UNITED ARE 15% HIGHER THAN 2022 CHICAGO , APRIL 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNITED AIRLINES WILL FLY TO 114 DIFFERENT INTERNATIONAL CITIES THIS SUMMER AND HAS EXPANDED ITS FLYING BY 25% VERSUS LAST YEAR TO MEET THE SHARP INCREASE IN DEMAND FOR TRAVEL OUTSIDE OF THE U.S. THE AIRLINE IS ALREADY THE LARGEST CARRIER ACROSS BOTH THE ATLANTIC AND PACIFIC AND THIS SUMMER'S SCHEDULE INCLUDES NEARLY 25 NEW ROUTES. ACCORDING TO UNITED BOOKING DATA, INTERNATIONAL BOOKINGS ARE ALREADY 15% HIGHER THAN THE SAME PERIOD IN 2022*."}